    description: "STATEMENT: a stub on any receiver is not bound to a method of a class merely because the caller instantiates that class somewhere. OBSERVED: the linker (priority 35) reads the stubs the adapters now leave; ADR-0064's sample put class_hint at 6 wrong of 15. JS/TS five trees 67 -> 80 (137 before the second round typed more receivers); C# 123 -> 47. Decide with the owner's O1 ruling whether class_hint stays a reason to bind.\n\nEvidence and method: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/pilot_11252026/DESIGN.md and final/ (maps mine_e948 at e948d2ae3 against before/ at dev 0d3c12ff4; hand samples seed 20261125). Found during the ADR-0064 pilot (rust, csharp, javascript/typescript); not built there because fewer than two of the three pilot languages need it, or because it is the analyzer's own."  # 50f5
